{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这些单位不是一棵树。叙事树（剧/季或电影 → 幕 → 段落 → 场 → 拍点）与交付树（剧 → 季 → 集 → 场 → 覆盖 → 镜头 → 条）共享「场」；两棵树之间多对多（集 × 幕、集 × 段落）。时间轴上还叠着 cue、字幕、拍点这些区间，与镜头多对多；环境与人物资产被多处共享引用。",
    "en": "These units do not form a single tree. A narrative tree (series/season or film → act → sequence → scene → beat) and a delivery tree (series → season → episode → scene → coverage → shot → take) share the scene; the two trees relate many-to-many (episode × act, episode × sequence). Interval layers on the timeline — cues, subtitles, beats — overlap shots many-to-many, and background and character assets are shared references."
  },
