      "id": "act",
      "zh": "幕",
      "en": "Act",
      "zh_alt": "",
      "category": "narrative",
      "module": "故事创作",
      "def_zh": "三幕结构的一大段：平常世界（建置）、特殊世界（对抗）、即兴决战（结局），大致占 1/4、1/2、1/4。电影里按整部片算，连续剧里按季算，所以一幕常跨好几集。",
      "def_en": "One major movement of the three-act structure — setup, confrontation, resolution, roughly 1/4, 1/2 and 1/4 of the story. McKee frames an act as a series of sequences ending in a climactic reversal. A film's acts span the film; a series' acts span a season.",
      "where": "1.1.1.3 三幕",
      "notes": [
        "三幕比例由 Syd Field 系统提出；幕的边界本身在理论界有争议。"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Three-act_structure",
        "https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/三幕剧"
      ],
