      "category": "narrative",
      "module": "故事创作",
      "def_zh": "让观众留下来的悬念：开场钩住；集尾把主角留在未解决的危险、两难或揭露里，促使追看下一集（悬念结尾）。",
      "def_en": "Suspense that keeps the audience: an opening hook, and a cliffhanger that ends an installment on an unresolved danger, dilemma or revelation to pull viewers into the next.",
      "where": "1.1.2.2 连续剧",
      "notes": [
        "cliffhanger 专指结尾的悬念；hook 更宽，开场三秒的钩子也算。"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cliffhanger"
