    {
      "id": "beat",
      "zh": "拍点",
      "en": "Beat",
      "zh_alt": "节拍",
      "category": "narrative",
      "module": "影视改编",
      "def_zh": "戏里最小的一次变化：一次动作与反应的交换，或一条新信息。几个拍点组成一场；一个镜头可含几个拍点，一个拍点也可跨几个镜头。",
      "def_en": "The smallest unit of structure: an exchange of action and reaction, or a piece of news (McKee). Beats build a scene; a shot may hold several beats and a beat may run across shots.",
      "where": "分镜按拍点选镜（1.2.5 镜头）",
      "notes": [
        "beat 至少四种含义：本表指剧作拍点（McKee）；剧本括号里的 (beat) 指短暂停顿；表演上的 beat 是表演单元；Save the Cat「节拍表」的节拍是全片层级的结构节点。",
        "同样的动作与反应重复多次仍算一个拍点，行为明显改变才算新拍点。"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beat_(filmmaking)",
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unit_of_action",
        "https://kindlepreneur.com/save-the-cat-beat-sheet"
      ],
      "in_graph": true,
      "x": 180,
      "y": 600
    },
    {
      "id": "coverage",
      "zh": "覆盖",
      "en": "Coverage",
      "zh_alt": "镜头覆盖",
      "category": "delivery",
      "module": "影视改编",
      "def_zh": "为一场戏拍下的全部镜头，剪辑用它们拼出这场。从一个镜头到几十个镜头都可以；问的是「剪辑能用多少种方式把这场拼出来」。",
      "def_en": "The full set of shots captured for a scene, which the editor assembles into the finished scene. It can be one shot or dozens; the guiding question is how many ways the editor can construct the scene.",
      "where": "1.2.4 覆盖",
      "notes": [
        "主镜头只是覆盖的一部分，不能代替覆盖。",
        "常见拍法先远后近：主镜头 → 每人中景 → 每人特写（标准覆盖）。",
        "多拍不等于剪得更好：覆盖不能代替决定。"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "https://studiobinder.com/blog/film-coverage"
      ],
      "in_graph": true,
