    {
      "id": "shot",
      "zh": "镜头",
      "en": "Shot",
      "zh_alt": "",
      "category": "delivery",
      "module": "影视改编",
      "def_zh": "一段不间断的连续画面：拍摄时从开机到停机，剪辑时是两个剪切点之间的一段。本剧里它也是视频生成的单位；要切镜就拆成多个镜头。",
      "def_en": "One uninterrupted run of footage — from camera start to stop when shooting, between two cuts when editing. In our pipeline it is also the unit of video generation; a cut means a new shot.",
      "where": "filming.json scenes[].shots[]，编号 st1；scenes/sN/shots/stN/",
      "notes": [
        "镜头是要拍的内容，条是这一镜拍的某一遍，机位是为拍它做的物理布置。",
        "「长焦镜」「远景」里的「镜头」指镜片或景别，与时长无关。"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shot_(filmmaking)"
      ],
