      "def_zh": "同一镜头的某一遍：实拍时是从开机到喊「卡」的一次录制；本剧里是一次生成结果。一个镜头可以有多条，选一条进剪辑。",
      "def_en": "One recorded attempt of a shot, from roll to cut; in our pipeline, one generated result. A shot may have several takes, and one is chosen for the edit.",
