      "def_zh": "对本场之内某个物件、细节或动作的特写，常从人物视线出发。",
      "def_en": "A close shot of an object, detail or action within the scene, often from a character's point of view.",
      "where": "1.2.5.1 功能镜头",
      "notes": [],
