      "module": "故事创作",
      "def_zh": "第二幕正中的转折，把第二幕一分为二：不可回头、倒计时、揭秘，风险升级。",
      "def_en": "The turn at the center of act two that splits it in half: a point of no return, a ticking clock or a revelation that raises the stakes.",
      "where": "1.1.1.3 三幕",
      "notes": [
